      "statement": "A test imports every pipeline module and fails any that exposes a ROOT or _ROOT attribute differing from the actual repository root, requiring modules to import ROOT from pipeline.core.paths rather than deriving it from file depth, with a third-party allowlist so a missing optional dependency skips instead of failing.",
